  Scenario: Multiple hooks in same file
    Given a Go file "hooks.go" with content:
      """
      package example

      import "context"

      //godogen:before
      func (s *Suite) setup(ctx context.Context) (context.Context, error) {
          return ctx, nil
      }

      //godogen:after
      func (s *Suite) teardown(ctx context.Context) (context.Context, error) {
          return ctx, nil
      }
      """
    When I run godogen
    Then the command should succeed
    And the file "hooks_initialize.go" should have content:
